  "indirect_review_notes": {
    "USBPD": "Mappings reviewed against ST callbacks, archive disassembly and REV1 settings. Empty sets: trace callback remains NULL, VDM/VCONN/role swaps are disabled, TCPP VBUS callback is never registered. USBPD_Callback struct pointers are installed only during init.",
    "USBD": "Since v8.10 the audio personality registers USBD_AUDIO_CAT (usbd_cat.c): the core reaches its cat_class_* callbacks through pClass, and they call the USB audio class callbacks (USBD_AUDIO_*) directly or service the CAT ports in O(1)."
  },
  "stack_budget_note": "REV1 includes libm/ST archive allocations and reviewed indirect callbacks, previously omitted. 6 KiB linker stack is checked against foreground plus nested priority 2/1/0 IRQ chains and 104-byte Cortex-M4F frames.",
